/* ================= STAFF / SUPER ADMIN ================= */
// Staff is split into three sub-roles, chosen at login (?role= on every /staff* URL):
//  · moderator  — reviews listings, temples, service providers, partners, bookings & daily charts
//  · accountant — financial reports, vendor/partner/dealer payouts, manual NEFT sheet
//  · admin      — Portal admin. To keep this from turning into one giant flat menu (the thing
//    that made the old Portal-admin sidebar confusing), the admin's own dashboard is organised
//    into three clearly-labelled, independently expandable sections in one sidebar:
//      1. Staff panel   — every moderator tool, unchanged, just nested here for a Portal admin
//      2. Accountant view — every accountant tool, unchanged, nested the same way
//      3. Administrator  — the Portal admin's OWN scope: analytics, staff/dealer management,
//         master data, gateway & platform configuration, branding, notifications, backup
// Moderator and Accountant, when they log in directly as themselves, keep their own simple
// single-purpose sidebar exactly as before — only the admin's view gets this 3-way split.
